# PetelAssistants

Before changes under `PetelAssistants/`, read:

1. [docs/agents/apps/petel-assistants.md](../../docs/agents/apps/petel-assistants.md) — dual-schema tenancy, security endpoints
2. [docs/agents/apps/petel-assistants-domain.md](../../docs/agents/apps/petel-assistants-domain.md) — business rules
3. [docs/agents/reference/audit-fields.md](../../docs/agents/reference/audit-fields.md) — creator column is `user_id`/`UserId`

Year UI flow: [PetelAssistants/docs/year-management-screens.md](../../PetelAssistants/docs/year-management-screens.md).

**Critical:** `GET session/timeout-config` must exist or client defaults to 10 min idle timeout. All five `SecurityController` endpoints required — missing endpoints degrade silently.
